goksen.ing for Herdr

The mods g-agents, g-changes, g-confirm, g-files, g-help, g-machine-add,
g-menu, g-new-menu, g-pane, g-peek, g-picker, g-prompt, g-spaces, g-tabs,
g-toast, g-workspace-chrome, g-workspace-status and g-worktree, and the
layout goksen.json, started as copies of the mods and layout that ship with
the Herdr app (Apache License 2.0). They were changed to restyle them and to
add stepped motion.

The mods g-palette, g-rename-tab, g-rename-space, g-settings and g-specimen,
the theme goksen-ing.json and shared/motion.js are new.
